  id: clue_001_paper
  title: Thorn Paper
  description: 'Damaged piece of paper, I can barely read it. It says: "Hey, ....
    i forget on top of one orange box, near the side gate ... other key ... don''t
    lost this one or i ... (rest is a bunch of slurs and offenses)". Letters leave
    no digital trace, but the letter itself could be traceable... There''s something
    wrong here... '
